{"v":4,"catch":"接受成為Tetris®大師的挑戰！","desc":"《TETRIS® THE GRAND MASTER》是 ARIKA 於 1998 年發行的益智遊戲。\n與全球玩家一起測試自己！ 此版本具有排名認證系統，可分析您的速度、準確性和技術，將玩家分為 19 個技能水平！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-12-01","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/20d351b5922d3e90cfb1995d4a008a717463c8c4d7bf09293433ffd07347a3ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1cbc70a94769ba0bc36afd22eb2dc0fa562ccfcb6e62fd3891a2ecac27c9364f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3eb98eaf80a1cd9f622ab5b7280cbe1cb45e2b3874437d2fc9027817a3c942c5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1d41ec0392447daa210a78030761233a786a4ed6ecc84cdca9ea9e37470d11e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6c64af65cbbf42dbe9be3223bedbcb64f722188742105d62136eedb56e876446.jpg"],"titleId":"0100dfd016b7a000","dlc":[]}